  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Citizen science for landslide risk reduction and disaster resilience building in mountain regions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research and development activity contributing to the UK&#x2019;s strategy to address key development challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme has four focuses: disaster risk, subseasonal to seasonal forecasting, disaster risk monitoring, and the integration of these into practical decision making. The programme is targeting countries across subSaharan Africa and south Asia.</narrative>
